NAME
    gcloud vector-search collections data-objects - manage Vector Search data
        objects

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud vector-search collections data-objects COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Vector Search data objects.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     aggregate
        Aggregate data objects.

     batch-create
        Create a batch of data objects.

     batch-delete
        Delete a batch of data objects.

     batch-search
        Batch search data objects from a Vector Search collection.

     batch-update
        Update a batch of data objects.

     create
        Create a data object.

     delete
        Delete a data object.

     describe
        Describe a data object.

     query
        Query data objects from a Vector Search collection.

     search
        Search data objects from a Vector Search collection.

     update
        Update a data object.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud beta vector-search collections data-objects

